quartzfire-ssl-inspection (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: WatchGuard-style SSL inspection — Squid ssl_bump as the
    sole TLS terminator, self-signed inspection CA lifecycle, transparent
    interface-scoped interception, do-not-inspect (splice) list, a plain-HTTP
    CA distribution page on :4126, `service quartzfire ssl-inspection` config
    nodes, and the pre-wired (idle) ICAP content-filter seam.

